 true madness, a sweet refrain."}, {"beat": 180, "text": "[ solo ]"}, {"beat": 212, "text": "An evening at the bar, the soul somewhat light,"}, {"beat": 220, "text": "The wine that flows, hope taking flight,"}, {"beat": 228, "text": "In these light conversations, my heart awakes,"}, {"beat": 236, "text": "I sing my sadness, my joy it makes."}, {"beat": 244, "text": "[outro]"}, {"beat": 252, "text": ""}]}}}